WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:05.350
Hello. I'm Yuria Octave.

00:05.350 --> 00:08.480
My name is Eltria Octave.

00:08.480 --> 00:10.820
The leader of the Trade Federation.

00:11.510 --> 00:14.330
I'm quite busy, so I'll just ask.

00:15.410 --> 00:18.580
What does a member of the 
Demon Lord's army want with me?

00:19.310 --> 00:20.830
I'm serious!

00:21.900 --> 00:24.400
We've known each other 
for less than 12 hours!

00:24.400 --> 00:26.290
You don't know a thing about me!

00:27.280 --> 00:30.250
I'm sorry... I'm bothering you...

00:46.910 --> 00:48.010
Where am I?

01:05.900 --> 01:07.080
Is that her?

01:13.110 --> 01:17.470
I did it! This is the daughter 
of Xenobia's leader!

01:27.300 --> 01:29.020
No, it ain't.

01:29.020 --> 01:31.620
Huh? That's impossible.

01:35.160 --> 01:36.720
Well, it's fine.

01:36.720 --> 01:39.820
I was just thinking I wanted a maid.

01:45.230 --> 01:46.860
Master...

03:27.470 --> 03:31.980
<i>Pirates</i>

03:33.050 --> 03:34.880
I'm sorry!

03:34.880 --> 03:37.940
It's my fault that she was captured.

03:37.940 --> 03:41.630
It was probably the pirates.

03:41.630 --> 03:44.390
They've probably already fled out to sea.

03:44.390 --> 03:46.460
So it will be hard to find her.

03:48.110 --> 03:49.580
I'll look for her.

03:53.650 --> 03:55.040
Lend me a ship.

03:59.350 --> 04:00.440
Very well.

04:00.970 --> 04:03.020
Use the <i>Vedeen</i>.

04:38.840 --> 04:39.800
<i>Satie...</i>

04:41.280 --> 04:42.650
<i>Just wait.</i>

04:43.660 --> 04:45.340
<i>I'm coming for you.</i>

04:50.450 --> 04:52.600
You look good.

05:02.320 --> 05:04.860
Just the way I like my girls.

05:12.720 --> 05:15.580
Wh-Why am I dressed like this?

05:15.960 --> 05:18.670
A maid's job is to serve her master, right?

05:18.670 --> 05:22.550
She has to do whatever it takes 
to make her master happy.

05:23.140 --> 05:26.510
Your job is to do whatever I say.

05:30.330 --> 05:32.220
From now on, you're my maid.

05:32.660 --> 05:35.740
You're going to cook and clean for me.

05:36.790 --> 05:37.720
Okay...

05:39.650 --> 05:40.660
In exchange,

05:42.430 --> 05:44.470
I'll protect you.

05:46.560 --> 05:50.030
How about it? I don't think it's a bad deal.

05:56.050 --> 06:00.170
But I... want to work as a maid.

06:02.390 --> 06:04.590
How about I make you something to eat?

06:12.790 --> 06:18.160
Hm, that'll do nicely.

06:51.280 --> 06:52.840
U-Um...

06:54.030 --> 06:56.810
Do you have any alcohol?

06:56.810 --> 06:59.520
Something strong would be best.

06:59.940 --> 07:01.230
For you to drink?

07:01.230 --> 07:03.420
No, for flavoring the food.

07:04.590 --> 07:06.690
It makes it taste so much better.

07:11.010 --> 07:11.860
Here.

07:13.090 --> 07:14.760
Thank you.

07:35.590 --> 07:37.140
What are you doing?

07:37.680 --> 07:38.430
Move!

07:38.430 --> 07:39.140
Sorry!

07:44.150 --> 07:46.370
Idiot! Don't move!

07:54.760 --> 07:57.070
I thought I was a dead man.

07:57.690 --> 07:59.290
Hey, clean this up—

08:08.520 --> 08:10.760
There's a lot of noise from the kitchen.

08:10.760 --> 08:14.130
They're probably fighting over the grub.

08:15.510 --> 08:19.750
Everybody gets crazy when food's involved.

08:19.750 --> 08:21.290
You've got that right.

08:29.250 --> 08:32.280
This was stolen from the town.

08:33.020 --> 08:35.350
I need to tell Master.

08:41.690 --> 08:42.540
No...

08:43.080 --> 08:45.210
Even Master couldn't...

08:52.690 --> 08:57.760
He attacks when we least expect him!

08:58.290 --> 09:01.080
If we could at least find him...

09:17.930 --> 09:20.030
C-Carossa-sama!

09:20.880 --> 09:21.990
What?

09:22.380 --> 09:24.960
The ship! The ship...

09:27.210 --> 09:28.880
The ship is on fire!

09:30.880 --> 09:32.550
What the hell?!

09:32.550 --> 09:33.750
Hurry!

09:33.750 --> 09:36.000
Put the fire out! Put it out!

09:36.000 --> 09:37.220
Bring water!

09:42.940 --> 09:44.340
Master!

09:44.880 --> 09:46.520
Please find me!

09:56.560 --> 09:58.880
That bitch! Where did she go?

09:58.880 --> 10:01.030
When we find her, she's gonna pay!

10:01.320 --> 10:03.920
Hey, don't try to have all the fun yourself.

10:03.920 --> 10:05.680
Whoever finds her first gets her!

10:05.680 --> 10:06.870
Just find her!

10:06.870 --> 10:07.600
Right.

10:10.000 --> 10:11.580
She's not here.

10:20.560 --> 10:22.280
Haha, surprised you?

10:22.280 --> 10:26.770
My nose can find a woman anywhere!

10:27.050 --> 10:28.390
Come on out!

10:30.950 --> 10:32.560
Now, stay still.

10:34.420 --> 10:35.030
No...

10:46.150 --> 10:47.950
You stupid bitch!

10:47.950 --> 10:50.540
<i>He'll come! I know he will!</i>

10:50.540 --> 10:52.170
Ike-sama!

11:00.310 --> 11:02.140
I won't kill you.

11:02.990 --> 11:08.560
But bad maids need to be punished.

11:09.120 --> 11:12.770
For today, it'll just be your leg.

11:22.090 --> 11:23.410
No!

11:34.680 --> 11:36.450
Who the hell are you?

11:44.950 --> 11:47.970
I made a vow to protect her.

11:49.720 --> 11:51.730
You're going to pay!

12:00.720 --> 12:02.490
M-Master.

12:02.490 --> 12:04.660
Satie, it's okay now.

12:07.930 --> 12:08.910
Kill him!

12:18.520 --> 12:19.760
Bastard!

12:44.560 --> 12:46.390
Is it over?

12:46.390 --> 12:48.540
Yes. Are you okay?

12:49.240 --> 12:51.560
Yes. I'm fine.

12:51.560 --> 12:54.120
Really? I hope you weren't hurt.

12:54.120 --> 12:54.960
Can you walk?

12:57.690 --> 12:58.670
Um...

13:00.620 --> 13:02.630
I'm really fine.

13:02.630 --> 13:05.340
Thank you... for protecting 
someone like me.

13:06.170 --> 13:11.390
I'm just a slave who you could 
throw away at any time.

13:12.400 --> 13:14.380
You're my maid.

13:15.320 --> 13:18.730
A master would never abandon his maid, right?

13:19.640 --> 13:21.150
Master...

13:21.690 --> 13:23.190
I saw your message.

13:35.140 --> 13:38.360
I saw that you believed in me.

13:43.680 --> 13:45.990
You did great, Satie.

13:46.440 --> 13:48.340
Th-Thank you!

13:48.720 --> 13:51.770
It seems you're no ordinary mage.

13:55.980 --> 13:56.690
What?

13:56.690 --> 13:57.690
Master!

14:08.930 --> 14:12.280
I'll give you credit for finding this ship.

14:12.800 --> 14:15.420
But that girl is mine.

14:18.110 --> 14:19.880
And it's time for you to disappear!

14:39.790 --> 14:42.070
How long are you going to keep running?

14:43.800 --> 14:45.650
We're in the middle of the ocean!

14:46.120 --> 14:47.610
Give up and die!

15:07.270 --> 15:09.090
Did I overdo it?

15:23.760 --> 15:24.780
I told you...

15:25.670 --> 15:27.610
that you were going to pay.

15:29.970 --> 15:32.700
Your days as a pirate are over!

15:34.080 --> 15:36.470
Wh-What are you going to do?

15:48.530 --> 15:50.190
What happened?

16:00.500 --> 16:01.980
Carossa?!

16:03.770 --> 16:05.440
Okay, let's head back.

16:05.710 --> 16:06.950
Ike-san?

16:08.400 --> 16:08.900
Huh?

16:10.300 --> 16:12.650
It's all over.

16:27.470 --> 16:28.980
This is all thanks to you, Satie.

16:30.480 --> 16:34.110
You told me where their ship was, 
so I was able to defeat them

16:34.720 --> 16:36.770
and take back what was stolen.

16:37.780 --> 16:38.780
You did great.

16:39.260 --> 16:40.180
Thank you.

16:43.830 --> 16:47.860
I didn't expect you to capture him alive.

16:48.400 --> 16:50.450
I don't like to kill if I can avoid it.

16:52.340 --> 16:55.570
That's a strange thing for someone 
in the Demon Lord's army to say.

16:57.040 --> 17:01.040
As promised, we'll give 
you your trade treaty.

17:01.040 --> 17:01.540
Then...

17:01.540 --> 17:04.920
It will be kept secret, though.

17:05.450 --> 17:08.500
Nothing good will come from the 
Alliance of Kings finding out.

17:08.810 --> 17:10.330
Secret it is, then.

17:10.330 --> 17:13.210
I'm happy just to have the treaty.

17:14.420 --> 17:15.730
Excellent.

17:16.260 --> 17:17.510
Now...

17:17.510 --> 17:21.020
Let's go over the exact
 details of the treaty.

17:40.060 --> 17:42.790
How much food do we have left?

17:43.070 --> 17:45.250
Three days' worth, at best.

17:45.610 --> 17:49.260
There's barely anything left 
to eat inside the walls.

17:49.260 --> 17:52.670
Making us attack this place may
 have been a trap to begin with.

17:55.130 --> 17:57.840
So they intend to starve us.

17:59.490 --> 18:00.550
We're attacking.

18:00.550 --> 18:02.810
But you're wounded.

18:03.310 --> 18:05.870
Will things get better if we wait?

18:06.960 --> 18:08.240
Well...

18:09.000 --> 18:12.320
I'm not the type to just wait to die.

18:12.320 --> 18:15.220
I'll take as many of them with me as I can.

18:32.340 --> 18:33.680
Master!

18:38.160 --> 18:41.090
Those clothes look great on you!

18:41.530 --> 18:42.640
Do they?

18:43.170 --> 18:44.700
You look great, too.

18:45.920 --> 18:47.060
That makes me happy.

18:47.440 --> 18:50.270
Shouldn't you be resting, though?

18:50.270 --> 18:54.730
I can't miss a party they're 
holding for the two of us!

18:55.740 --> 18:58.700
Eltria-sama even gave me this dress!

18:59.440 --> 19:00.820
Ike-sama!

19:02.160 --> 19:06.120
Where did you go? You left me behind!

19:06.550 --> 19:08.480
Get off me.

19:08.480 --> 19:10.330
I was lonely.

19:13.010 --> 19:16.250
Everyone is watching.
Is that really appropriate?

19:22.370 --> 19:23.950
Your collar's a mess.

19:23.950 --> 19:24.700
Oh.

19:31.600 --> 19:34.320
Let's go. My mother is waiting.

19:34.320 --> 19:35.080
Okay.

19:50.410 --> 19:54.380
Is that the lucky man who 
won Miss Yuria's heart?

19:54.380 --> 19:56.550
He looks surprisingly normal.

19:56.550 --> 19:58.880
But he's kind of cute.

20:00.320 --> 20:02.210
Ignore them.

20:02.960 --> 20:07.090
To me, you're the most 
handsome man in the world.

20:07.090 --> 20:09.350
Th-Thanks.

20:13.780 --> 20:15.770
Yuria, come here.

20:16.330 --> 20:17.320
Mother!

20:18.980 --> 20:21.680
You're as cute as ever today.

20:21.680 --> 20:22.450
Thank you.

20:22.690 --> 20:25.010
And you have good taste, too.

20:25.970 --> 20:28.030
I'm your daughter, after all.

20:29.630 --> 20:32.000
Take care of Yuria, then.

20:34.380 --> 20:37.090
Take care of her how, exactly?

20:38.510 --> 20:40.170
Well, you...

20:40.830 --> 20:42.710
The treaty's been signed,

20:42.710 --> 20:45.800
so you need to meet my other condition.

20:45.800 --> 20:46.890
Huh?

20:49.660 --> 20:54.410
Thank you all for coming tonight.

20:55.320 --> 21:00.280
We will now begin Yuria-sama and 
Ike-sama's betrothal ceremony.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.080
Um, I...

21:06.080 --> 21:09.950
If you refuse, the treaty's off.

21:10.230 --> 21:10.850
What?

21:11.360 --> 21:13.160
But this is so sudden...

21:23.810 --> 21:25.240
What is this?

21:25.870 --> 21:27.340
Everyone get outside!

21:34.830 --> 21:36.140
I've come to visit.

21:38.180 --> 21:40.900
D-Demon Lord?

21:41.330 --> 21:44.860
Ike, you need to head back now.

21:55.810 --> 21:57.880
Cefiro is in danger.

23:34.350 --> 23:38.850
<i>Cefiro Is Defeated</i>
